# Claude Code IDE mirror (.claude/commands/**/agents) is generated by
# `npm run sync:ide` and committed, mirroring the Codex side (.codex/agents).
# The Compatibility Parity Gate validates the committed mirror against source,
# so squad orqx command files MUST be tracked (do not gitignore them).

# Published squads (whitelisted for repository)
# Governance: SINAPSE is an open-source framework. Production-ready squads
# (those with a populated squad.yaml + agents/ + tasks/ + knowledge-base/)
# are published so the framework's real surface area is visible to users.
# To keep a squad private, remove its whitelist entry AND document the reason.
squads/*
!squads/.gitkeep
!squads/claude-code-mastery/
!squads/squad-animations/
!squads/squad-artdir/
!squads/squad-brand/
!squads/squad-claude/
!squads/squad-cloning/
